            <div xml:id="m-9a9c5d00-ee21-49b8-b245-fe6dd1757976">
              <lg xml:id="m-7510045d-b1ed-4b3b-9c8c-c8774d9a5f62">
                <l xml:id="m-9eb44d54-bac7-4bf2-a64f-9ef4cc125a9a" facs="#m-9cae1432-bc21-46ca-81cc-b0835289705c" label="text-like">Common of a Virgin Martyr. Mass II.</l><l xml:id="m-fe562d16-24cf-45f1-a0bf-bfb158e8bc4d" facs="#m-a01a96de-e603-4496-b979-c23f332bd249" label="ambiguous">1220</l><l xml:id="m-ba7a7420-64b3-4233-9ac3-d70b83d2c505" facs="#m-e0f1886f-4a34-4998-8000-514f91ed7e2e" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff41dfaa-3ff1-4f9b-888c-ff4d5080ae90" facs="#m-9a76c660-2a45-4ca9-a0b6-113e2b73e68f" label="ambiguous">mi-no. T. P. Al-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-f801a924-583c-496a-ae34-a29876f03aaa" facs="#m-5c94f0f2-8998-4002-9c77-2cf2cd4d6de1" label="lyrics-like">ré¬gi</l><l xml:id="m-e39533f2-e0af-47e9-a858-973e55f005ae" facs="#m-f14c9913-c854-48fe-8462-079644dd794d" label="ambiguous">plum</l><l xml:id="m-2659e17f-3062-41f3-83bd-ef3e8b9b4ee9" facs="#m-878c1c23-49d4-441a-b199-885762e5f45e" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0a42ed2e-3539-4ebe-9765-96e6c00a8361" facs="#m-8550f23a-fdc6-4714-b78a-b706b8adc36c" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-802d6c64-eddf-4d76-a994-5f94adc957f0" facs="#m-8ac156b0-e3e8-417a-8371-d4d9139460f4" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe Dómine múnera, quae cujus nos confídimus patrocínio</l><l xml:id="m-7204bf2a-9b46-4de4-8b32-dc8b94374b85" facs="#m-fa353d36-24e7-431b-959f-f2a5cacabcd7" label="lyrics-like">O in beâtae N. Virginis et Már-liberári. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5717b7e3-bc72-46b0-b6b5-6f9fdb44ad2a" facs="#m-2686ed9f-7720-4be4-8208-7a5efa5ae862" label="lyrics-like">tyris tuae solemnitáte deférimus:</l><l xml:id="m-c9768339-244d-4214-ba2d-cdbfb3507778" facs="#m-51b2f1d6-df20-4afa-b17b-7f72f0c22ab2" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-14320911-f1d4-4d94-9601-891b500d9345" facs="#m-cfb94bff-8486-4125-8796-5957dba98354" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-f83fd7ba-0333-4575-8c06-30ea966beb50" facs="#m-7ece4328-44bc-45d3-900b-b35d00c037f2" label="lyrics-like">Onfundántur supér¬ bi,</l><l xml:id="m-ae620164-3199-414e-8e2b-253e7c162bdb" facs="#m-f28024bf-7806-4a0a-8645-feb078b4e4f7" label="lyrics-like">qui-a injú-ste</l><l xml:id="m-59437763-b7c5-4e6b-ac44-6ec985bb7e8e" facs="#m-639c874e-424b-4660-b573-2b62b4c2d9a2" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-c137089a-f955-463b-8646-508d5924b1eb" facs="#m-179a8a59-19c8-48e1-8f3b-6702fd9d7f09" label="lyrics-like">in-iqui-tá- tem fecé-runt in me : é-go au-tem</l><l xml:id="m-c4704ce1-61c2-4dc0-bd9b-e2df3ba449a4" facs="#m-733977c1-abd4-491e-a91d-3dea8f057a71" label="lyrics-like">in tú-is justi-fi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c5fb37a-e82c-446b-a888-f78bad30227e" facs="#m-d0f9d342-925b-4d94-81a7-16e3f3ecdaa4" label="lyrics-like">mandá-tis tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-2effc0d4-d88d-4831-876f-664a10b2edae" facs="#m-6fef247e-d6db-46a8-8f7f-ca7e9e85d66b" label="lyrics-like">is exercé¬ bor,</l><l xml:id="m-0d6a5136-2697-48fa-9ee9-622632044b64" facs="#m-a7a5f70e-16ec-48e5-8bda-467b37efecdd" label="ambiguous">ca-ti-6- nibus,</l><l xml:id="m-1689e1da-ad02-4291-9c0c-560fd2aeea49" facs="#m-442316bd-512a-4963-a524-75b51a3c5b34" label="lyrics-like">ut non confún-dar. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-b6c87537-e14a-4722-90d2-a040a08ca829" facs="#m-0cbc4bfd-706c-4306-be8a-bf3752a73ca0" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4a8216a6-d6a8-4934-ae5f-02e53348349c" facs="#m-ad3ab4b1-c383-4292-bfe3-3abb160948ca" label="lyrics-like">Postcómmunion.</l><l xml:id="m-c2e297e8-3d69-47ce-8d16-6972935ac583" facs="#m-d3ecc9b0-b84d-4649-9b76-a6055f2371ea" label="lyrics-like">Uxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sum- sempitérna fáciant protectióne gau¬</l><l xml:id="m-b8294573-1426-4518-a480-bc01e0cb36b3" facs="#m-e19e8f3d-a3b6-4309-bbd1-14431c4bfc8a" label="lyrics-like">A pta mystéria: et, intercedénte dére. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2007e383-7bc3-45ec-a071-a0b7b4b71969" facs="#m-e9a50f7f-a2e4-45e1-931c-f5f8354fb8c4" label="lyrics-like">beâta N. Virgine et Mártyre tua,</l><l xml:id="m-4f6e8e61-5032-403e-88c4-53ec45376992" facs="#m-343144af-7025-4dae-b7bf-65917ad99eb4" label="text-like">H. ANOTHER MASS OF A VIRGIN MARTYR.</l><l xml:id="m-6509af14-6509-4300-b74a-7d051ab716b0" facs="#m-d104e873-8838-472a-8c49-8da5bad301f9" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-65271371-c83c-4006-aa86-e6e3b5b43bd0" facs="#m-8b067aa4-df3c-4cf4-853b-b1ad46510d9e" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-e9496c0f-5a43-4834-8f5a-4a58752441a1" facs="#m-6b472e21-7ea8-4d5c-a23d-52707377ce42" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-b8f77ed1-d8be-4895-a837-a8922c253757" facs="#m-692918c5-cd19-4fb2-8946-efeea89f42f8" label="ambiguous">E</l><l xml:id="m-0f313095-f786-4bf9-8337-1a48a961ad55" facs="#m-eac55751-4e85-4c24-8290-addcf6afead3" label="lyrics-like">exspectavé- runt * pec-ca-tó¬ res,</l><l xml:id="m-6d3864b8-99f7-40dd-9f3b-7f0059b670ef" facs="#m-e4239429-563d-46c5-a5c2-b87bc921b0ad" label="ambiguous">ut</l></lg>
